# Chat Report: Rumor Debug / Viewer Implementation

**Date:** January 15, 2025  
**Session Focus:** Admin Panel - Rumor Debug / Viewer Feature

## Overview

Implemented a comprehensive Rumor Debug / Viewer section in the admin panel to allow browsing and inspecting all rumor JSON files as the RumorEngine sees them. This is a read-only debugging tool for inspecting rumor data structure and content.

## Features Implemented

### 1. Rumor Viewer Page (`admin/rumor_viewer.php`)
- **Complete Implementation** – New PHP page with full rumor browsing functionality
- **Header/Footer Integration** – Uses standard admin panel header and footer includes
- **Navigation Link** – Added "📰 Rumors" button to admin panel navigation

### 2. Filter Controls
- **Source File Filter** – Dropdown to select "All Rumors (merged)" or individual rumor files
- **Category Filter** – Dropdown to filter by category type
- **Rarity Filter** – Dropdown to filter by rarity level
- **Text Search** – Search box for filtering by text content in text, ghost_text, and gm_notes fields
- **Per Page Control** – Dropdown to set items per page (20, 50, 100)
- **Responsive Width** – Category and Rarity filters set to 50% width (12.5% of container)

### 3. Rumor Table
- **Column Structure** – ID, Category, Rarity, Targets, Sources, Text Preview
- **Sortable Columns** – Click headers to sort ascending/descending with visual indicators
- **Colored Badges** – Rarity and category displayed with color-coded badges
  - Rarity: common (gray), uncommon (green), rare (gold), very rare (orange), legendary (purple)
  - Category: Media (blue), Street (orange), Elysium (brown), Politics (red), Society (purple), Crime (crimson), Supernatural (purple)
- **Text Truncation** – Long text values truncated with ellipsis and full text in tooltip
- **Consistent Styling** – Uses same `.character-table` styling as admin panel character table

### 4. Action Buttons
- **View Details (👁️)** – Opens modal with full rumor information
- **Edit Details (✏️)** – Opens same modal (placeholder for future edit functionality)
- **Delete (🗑️)** – Placeholder alert (read-only viewer maintained)
- **Removed Expand Button** – Inline expand functionality removed, all details in modal

### 5. View/Edit Modal
- **Bootstrap Modal** – Matches styling from admin panel character view modal
- **Complete Information Display** – Shows ID, Category, Rarity, Text, Ghost Text, GM Notes, Targets, Source Types, Delivery Contexts, Plot IDs, Source File, Prerequisites, Weight Modifiers
- **Badge Rendering** – Category and rarity displayed with colored badges in modal
- **Formatted Display** – JSON fields (prerequisites, weight_modifiers) shown as formatted code blocks
- **Accessibility** – Proper ARIA attributes and focus management
- **Readable Text** – Light text color for readability on dark background

### 6. PC Rumor History Lookup
- **Optional Section** – Separate section below main table
- **PC ID Input** – Text input for entering PC ID
- **History Display** – Shows rumor_id, times_shown, last_shown_night from `data/state/rumor_history_<PC_ID>.json`
- **Error Handling** – Friendly message if no history file exists for PC ID

### 7. Client-Side Functionality
- **JavaScript Filtering** – Real-time filtering as user types/changes filters
- **Sorting Logic** – Client-side sorting of table rows
- **Pagination** – Dynamic pagination based on per-page setting
- **State Persistence** – Per-page setting saved to localStorage
- **Badge Rendering** – JavaScript functions matching PHP badge rendering for modal

## Technical Details

### PHP Functions
- `loadAllRumors()` – Loads and merges all JSON files from `data/rumors/*.json`
- `loadRumorFile($filename)` – Loads rumors from specific file
- `loadRumorHistory($pcId)` – Loads PC-specific rumor history
- `getRumorFiles()` – Returns list of available rumor files
- `render_rarity_badge($rarity)` – Generates HTML for rarity badges with colors
- `render_category_badge($category)` – Generates HTML for category badges with colors
- `truncate_text($text, $maxLength)` – Truncates text with ellipsis

### JavaScript Functions
- `applyFilters(resetPage)` – Main filtering function combining all filter types
- `updatePagination(visibleRows)` – Manages pagination and page button generation
- `sortRumorTable(column, direction)` – Client-side table sorting
- `initializeRumorSorting()` – Sets up click handlers for sortable headers
- `renderRarityBadge(rarity)` – JavaScript version of PHP rarity badge renderer
- `renderCategoryBadge(category)` – JavaScript version of PHP category badge renderer
- Modal population logic for View and Edit buttons

### CSS Styling
- Reused `.character-table-wrapper` and `.character-table` classes from admin panel
- Custom column width rules using `nth-child` selectors
- Badge styling for rarity and category colors
- Filter control responsive widths
- Modal styling matching admin panel character view modal

